@startuml
!theme plain
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Parsed : JSON syntax valid
Draft --> Rejected : syntax error
Parsed --> Resolved : references/imports resolved
Parsed --> Rejected : unresolved reference
Resolved --> Validated : semantic checks pass
Resolved --> Rejected : type/layout error
Validated --> Registered : persisted with version/hash
Registered --> Generating : generation requested
Generating --> ArtifactAvailable : build and conformance pass
Generating --> GenerationFailed : build/test failure
GenerationFailed --> Generating : retry with corrected generator/options
ArtifactAvailable --> Deprecated : superseded or withdrawn
Registered --> Deprecated : schema withdrawn
Deprecated --> Archived
Rejected --> Draft : corrected and resubmitted
@enduml
